WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.990
"Jim, my love," she cried, "do not look at me that way.

2
00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:11.810
I had my hair cut and sold because I could not have lived through Christmas without giving you a gift.

3
00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:14.790
My hair will grow out again.

4
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:17.450
I just had to do it.

5
00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:20.470
My hair grows very fast.

6
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.890
Say 'Merry Christmas!' Jim, and let us be happy.

7
00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:31.550
You do not know what a nice-- what a beautiful, nice gift I have for you."

8
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:45.070
"You have cut off your hair?" asked Jim, slowly, as if he had not accepted the information even after his mind worked very hard.

9
00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:49.510
"Cut it off and sold it," said Della.

10
00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:52.870
"Do you not like me just as well?

11
00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:55.990
I am the same person without my hair, right?

12
00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:02.230
Jim looked about the room as if he were looking for something.

13
00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:07.010
"You say your hair is gone?" he asked.

14
00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:10.930
"You need not look for it," said Della.

15
00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:14.770
"It is sold, I tell you--sold and gone, too.

16
00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.950
It is Christmas Eve, boy.

17
00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:21.210
Be good to me, for it was cut for you.

18
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:31.510
Maybe the hairs of my head were numbered," she went on with sudden serious sweetness, "but nobody could ever count my love for you.

19
00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:35.090
Shall I put the meat on, Jim?"

20
00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:43.210
Jim seemed to awaken quickly and put his arms around Della.

21
00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:48.170
Then he took a package from his coat and threw it on the table.

22
00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:52.730
"Do not make any mistake about me, Dell," he said.

23
00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:58.870
"I do not think there is any haircut that could make me like my girl any less.

24
00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:05.270
But if you will open that package you may see why you had me frightened at first."

25
00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:11.590
White fingers quickly tore at the string and paper.

26
00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:27.010
There was a scream of joy; and then, alas! a change to tears and cries, requiring the man of the house to use all his skill to calm his wife.

27
00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:43.310
For there were the combs -- the special set of objects to hold her hair that Della had wanted ever since she saw them in a shop window.

28
00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:57.970
Beautiful combs, made of shells, with jewels at the edge --just the color to wear in the beautiful hair that was no longer hers.

29
00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:07.990
They cost a lot of money, she knew, and her heart had wanted them without ever hoping to have them.

30
00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:19.470
And now, the beautiful combs were hers, but the hair that should have touched them was gone.

31
00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:35.310
But she held the combs to herself, and soon she was able to look up with a smile and say, "My hair grows so fast, Jim!"

32
00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:41.830
Then Della jumped up like a little burned cat and cried, "Oh, oh!"

33
00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:46.570
Jim had not yet seen his beautiful gift.

34
00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:51.470
She happily held it out to him in her open hands.

35
00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:54.810
The silver chain seemed so bright.

36
00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:58.310
"Isn't it wonderful, Jim?

37
00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:01.430
I looked all over town to find it.

38
00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:05.850
You will have to look at the time a hundred times a day now.

39
00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:07.450
Give me your watch.

40
00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:10.110
I want to see how it looks on it."

41
00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:19.710
Instead of obeying, Jim fell on the couch and put his hands under the back of his head and smiled.

42
00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:29.490
"Dell," said he, "let us put our Christmas gifts away and keep them a while.

43
00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:33.630
They are too nice to use just right now.

44
00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:41.090
I sold my gold watch to get the money to buy the set of combs for your hair.

45
00:04:41.980 --> 00:04:44.590
And now, why not put the meat on."
